<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head><%- include('partials/lkm_std_head') %><%- include('partials/lkm_ed_extra') %><%- include('partials/lkm_mkplc_extra') %></head>
<body>
<div class="container-fluid">
<% const g = (n) => '<div class="garis-isi"></div>'.repeat(n); %>
<% const cb = '<span class="cb"></span>'; %>
<%- include('partials/lkm_std_top', { nomorLkm: 2, subLkm: 'Input/Output Digital: Saklar, Debouncing, LED/Relay', nilaiNo: 2 }) %>

<div class="sect-title">A. Rangkaian Input dan Output</div>
<div class="dua-kolom">
  <div>
    <div class="sub-title" style="margin-top:0;">Gambar skema rangkaian yang dibuat</div>
    <div class="kotak-gambar" style="height:115px;"></div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <table class="tt">
      <caption>Penggunaan pin</caption>
      <thead><tr><th>Komponen</th><th>Pin</th><th>Mode</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <% ['Push button','LED / relay','Resistor pull','Pin cadangan'].forEach(k => { %><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><%= k %></td><td class="k"></td><td></td></tr><% }) %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="catatan-kecil">Kolom Mode: INPUT, INPUT_PULLUP, atau OUTPUT.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="sect-title">B. Logika Pembacaan Tombol</div>
<table class="tt">
  <thead><tr><th rowspan="2">Kondisi tombol</th><th colspan="2">Pull-up</th><th colspan="2">Pull-down</th></tr>
  <tr><th>Level pin (HIGH/LOW)</th><th>Nilai digitalRead</th><th>Level pin (HIGH/LOW)</th><th>Nilai digitalRead</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><strong>Tidak ditekan</strong></td><td class="k"></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>Ditekan</strong></td><td class="k"></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="sect-title">C. Pengamatan Bouncing</div>
<p class="catatan-kecil">Tekan tombol sekali dengan mantap per percobaan. Catat hitungan pada Serial Monitor.</p>
<table class="tt">
  <thead><tr><th style="width:8%;">Penekanan ke</th><th style="width:22%;">Hitungan terbaca tanpa debounce</th><th style="width:22%;">Hitungan terbaca dengan debounce</th><th style="width:16%;">Status LED / relay</th><th>Catatan</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <% for (let i = 1; i <= 8; i++) { %><tr><td><%= i %></td><td class="k" style="height:20px;"></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><% } %>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="halaman-baru">
<%- include('partials/kop_surat') %>
<div class="sect-title">D. Sketsa Sinyal Bouncing</div>
<p class="catatan-kecil">Gambarkan bentuk sinyal pin tombol saat ditekan (garis HIGH di atas, LOW di bawah) tanpa debounce dan dengan debounce.</p>
<div class="dua-kolom">
  <div><div class="judul-kecil">Tanpa debounce</div><div class="grid-kertas" style="height:120px;"><span class="sb-y">HIGH</span><span class="sb-x">waktu</span></div></div>
  <div><div class="judul-kecil">Dengan debounce</div><div class="grid-kertas" style="height:120px;"><span class="sb-y">HIGH</span><span class="sb-x">waktu</span></div></div>
</div>

<div class="sect-title">E. Uji Waktu Debounce</div>
<table class="tabel-data">
  <thead><tr><th style="width:24%;">Waktu debounce (ms)</th><th style="width:26%;">Hitungan salah dari 10 penekanan</th><th>Stabil? (Ya / Tidak)</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <% ['0','5','20','50','200'].forEach(w => { %><tr><td class="tengah t30"><%= w %></td><td></td><td></td></tr><% }) %>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="sect-title">F. Pertanyaan Analisis</div>
<div class="pertanyaan-item"><div class="no-pertanyaan">1. Mengapa kontak saklar mekanis dapat menimbulkan bouncing?</div><%- g(3) %></div>
<div class="pertanyaan-item"><div class="no-pertanyaan">2. Bandingkan cara kerja pull-up dan pull-down pada percobaan Anda.</div><%- g(3) %></div>
<div class="pertanyaan-item"><div class="no-pertanyaan">3. Berapa waktu debounce paling pas menurut data Tabel E? Mengapa terlalu besar juga kurang baik?</div><%- g(3) %></div>

<div class="sect-title">G. Kesimpulan</div>
<%- g(4) %>
<%- include('partials/lkm_std_bottom') %>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
